Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}既然这是瑞秋的生日  而且想要特别点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Since it's Rachel's birthday and we want it to be special...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想我会做水煮鲑鱼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...I thought I'd poach a salmon. GROUP: Oh.{\r}
