Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:19.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}问题是为什么每次办派对  你都要做水煮食物{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Question: Why do we always have to have parties where you poach things?{\r}
