Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}问题二  为什么我们办派对  一定要有委员会{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Question two: Why do we always have parties with committees?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.71,0:00:27.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我们为什么不能点些彼萨…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, yeah. Why can't we just get some pizzas...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}买几罐啤酒来狂欢   对啊{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and gets some beers and have fun? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.26,0:00:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我赞成  我想派对真正好玩{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Yeah, I agree. You know, I think fancy parties are only fun...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只有你打内心就喜欢它  但我不确定我们现在是{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...if you're fancy on the inside, and I'm just not sure we are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.52,0:00:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吧  你们不希望它很特别{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right. You guys don't want it to be special?{\r}
