Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊  它们不是真的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey, they're not real. Huh? Huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.78,0:00:50.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我在下面塞了很多东西  它们是假的{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I start miles beneath the surface of these things, okay? They're fake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.20,0:00:51.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}看到没  叭叭{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}See? Honk, honk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.24,0:00:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那像是给小丑看的色情片{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Wow, it's like porno for clowns.{\r}
