Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:02:00.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为她会偷东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because she, uh... She steals stuff.{\r}
