Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.77,0:02:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}或许她没偷东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Or maybe she doesn't steal stuff...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.60,0:02:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊只是跟她上过床  没回她电话{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and Joey slept with her and never called her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.69,0:02:12.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}乔伊  那太低级了  我喜欢她{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Joey, that is horrible. Hey, I liked her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}好吗  或许我太喜欢她了  我不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All right? Maybe too much. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.32,0:02:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想我只是害怕{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I guess I just got scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:19.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（编剧：艾利沙·强奇）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}天啊  抱歉  我不知道{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I'm sorry. I didn't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.70,0:02:25.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我以为没有人会相信  好吧{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Heh. I didn't think anyone would buy that. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.50,0:02:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}（导演：麦可·连贝克）{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.67,0:02:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}甜心  情况如何  那是来自地狱的毕业典礼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Hi, honey. How did it go? Ugh. It was the graduation from hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.55,0:02:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我表弟拿着足球奖学金下地狱{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, my cousin went to hell on a football scholarship.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那应该是个欢乐的场面{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}You know, I mean, this is supposed to be a joyous occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.26,0:02:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我妹妹大学毕业  没有人想得到她能毕业{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}My sister's graduating from college. Nobody thought she would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.89,0:02:44.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}应验了一句谚语 〝会咬人的狗不会叫〞{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a true testament to what a girl from Long Island would do for a Celica.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}发生了什么事  是我爸妈啦{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}So, what happened?  My parents happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.31,0:02:51.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们只需要坐在同一个体育馆  骄傲地微笑…{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}All they had to do was sit in the same stadium, smile proudly...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.61,0:02:54.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}…别提离婚的事  但是不行{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}...and not talk about the divorce. But no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.86,0:02:57.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}他们在毕业生致词时大吵一架{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}They got into a huge fight in the middle of the commencement address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.95,0:03:01.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}图图主教得停下来嘘他们{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Bishop Tutu actually had to stop and shush them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.12,0:03:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你们知道好消息是什么吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ugh. But you know what? You know what the good news is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.71,0:03:07.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}接下来我得端八小时的咖啡{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}I get to serve coffee for the next eight hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}我想我们不能邀她爸妈{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, so I guess we don't invite her parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.96,0:03:15.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}只邀她妈妈呢  为什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Well, how about just her mom? Why her mom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}因为我已经跟她开口了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Because I already invited her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.43,0:03:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}你邀了史黛西萝丝了吗{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Ooh, did you ask Stacy Roth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:21.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}不能邀请她{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Uh, can't invite her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.81,0:03:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}她也会偷东西{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}She also steals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.19,0:03:35.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}这是生日蜡烛  蛋糕在哪里{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, here are the candles. Where's the birthday cake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.11,0:03:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}没有生日蛋糕  我们要吃生日果馅饼{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Okay, we're not having birthday cake. We're having birthday flan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.28,0:03:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}什么{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.45,0:03:45.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}那是传统墨西哥馅饼甜点{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}It's a traditional Mexican custard dessert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.62,0:03:47.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnMicrosoft YaHei\fs19\bord1\shad1\3c&HFF8000&\b0}太棒了{\r}\N{\fnTahoma\fs10\bord1\shad1\1c&HC0C0C0&\b0}Whoa, that's nice.{\r}
